WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.188
Let’s walk through Blue Actions.

00:00:02.188 --> 00:00:05.013
Read the complete Blue submission before deciding.

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:08.575
Reconcile the active move, structured action fields, rationale

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.850
, and any requested team notifications;

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.975
reviewing and sharing are separate operator decisions.

00:00:13.975 --> 00:00:17.050
On this slide, review Blue Team submissions, accept

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.575
complete work, or return it with actionable improvement notes

00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:20.738
.

00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:25.000
In practice, a completed review changes workflow state explicitly

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.150
;

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.212
sharing forward is a separate, deliberate action.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.510
When you are ready, use Open Blue Actions to

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.322
move to the live surface.

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:36.035
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:36.185
.
